# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit real keys.
# Optional, but recommended for a large backfill. Anonymous Google Books
# requests can return HTTP 429 and slow the run while bounded retries finish.
# Without a key, the pipeline continues with OpenLibrary and the Library of
# Congress, but category-based call-number fallback may have less information.
# The CLI auto-loads .env on startup.
GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=
